schway-screen 1
screen history-timing-details
title Turn timing details
description F2 details list model calls, first output, retries, tool wall time and token totals with their caveats.
variant light-80
size 80x30
cursor 1 1 hidden
== text
 ⚡ schway  ~/demo on main

  Turn 1 details

  Attempt 1: interactive · /home/test/demo · started 2026-01-15 09:21 UTC · ✓█
  Done · 8m 24s                                                              ▀
    Git snapshots captured before and after the attempt
    Model: 12 calls · 2m 42s · first output 4.7s–31s · 1 retry, 1.0s backoff
    Tools: 30 timed calls · 5m 42s wall time
    Tokens: input 530,000 · cached input 429,300 · output 9,000 · reasoning
  7,000
  3 tool results; 0 failed tools.
  Commands: 3 exited 0, 0 nonzero, 0 without an observed exit.
  Token counts are what the provider reported, not billing. Cached input is
  part of input and reasoning is part of output.
  Model time adds every model attempt, including failed ones. Tool time is
  wall time with at least one tool running, so parallel tools count once;
  approval waits are part of it.
  Command times exclude approval waits. No first output means no text or
  thinking arrived before the call completed.

  History is recorded while turns run and kept beside the saved session. It
  is opened offline and read-only.


